~ start

if GameState.hide_chase_active
	PLUM: The right side of the closet doesn't close... (scared)
	PLUM: I don't think we should hide here. (worried)

	Hide in the closet?

	- Yes
		$> GameState.cancel_hide_chase()
		You hide in the closet.
		It's really cramped.
		PLUM: I'm scared... (crying)
		VINCENT: Hey, I'm here.
		You hear a loud bang outside the closet.

		- Peek out
			You peek out.
			???: Found you.
			[scene=game_over]
			=> END

		- Stay hidden
			$> GameState.mark_event_seen("workroom_chase_survived")
			You stay hidden...
			After a while there's no sound.
			You get out of the closet.
			VINCENT: What was that? (worried)
			VINCENT: We have to get out of here...
			VINCENT: Be safe okay? (worried) // scene of him kissing her
			=> END 

	- No
		You need to hurry up...
		=> END

else
	PLUM: There's nothing in the closet.

	- Open the left side
		You pull on the door.
		Nothing happens.
		=> END

	- Open the right side
		PLUM: There's enough space for me and dad to go inside. (silly)
		You pull on the door.
		Nothing happens.
		=> END